    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cd2acd86ec444745859b54f93f0a8467",
      "statement": "IRS Revenue Procedure 2025-41 N.3 supersedes FI-US-MUNI-CREDIT 2025-06 M.2 as to the threshold-dependent after-tax premise for affected taxpayers in taxable years beginning on or after 2026-01-01: it sets lower phase-out thresholds, reduces the AMT exemption above them, and applies the specified-PAB treatment to taxpayers above them regardless of prior thresholds, matching M.2's stated invalidation condition.",
      "evidence": [
